  "display_title": "My Dear Friend",
  "description": "In the novel \"My Dorothea,\" Maristella La Belflair is written as the titular character’s “dear friend,” but is more like her doormat. Ultimately executed due to Dorothea’s plot, she is given another chance at life after her death and is determined to survive this time. The problem is, she’s caught the eye of the male lead, Xavier, who is supposed to end up with Dorothea! With a love triangle and Dorothea’s schemes to deal with, can this former doormat step up to the challenges in her new life? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
